<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n20744" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βρᾰβ-εύς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">έως</span>,
			ὁ, 
			Att.
		 pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βραβῆς</span>: acc. sg.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βραβῆ</span> (v. infr.):—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>judge at the games</i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>El.</u>
				690
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				709
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				949a
			</span></i>: generally, <i>judge, arbitrator, umpire</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δίκης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Or.</u>
					1650
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λόγου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Med.</u>
					274
				</span></i>
			, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἀΐδην κοινὸν ἔθεντο
				βραβῆ</span> Epigr. ap. <i><span class="en">
				D.
				18.289
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> generally,
				<i>chief, leader</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μυρίας ἵππου β.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Pers.</u>
					302
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φιλόμαχοι β</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Ag.</u>
				230
			</span></i> (lyr.); <i>author</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μόχθων τῶν
				ἐν Ἰλίῳ</span>, of Helen, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Hel.</u>
				703
			</span></i>.</div>
